# Allow-list build context: send only what the Dockerfile needs. Everything else
# (.git, docs/, bin/, node_modules/, local env files, coverage, editor state...) stays out,
# which keeps builds fast and prevents secrets or stale artifacts from leaking into layers.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/

# Generated / installed content inside allowed directories.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/.gitkeep

# Tests are not part of the image; excluding them avoids needless cache busts.
**/*_test.go
web/**/*.test.ts
web/**/*.test.tsx

# Never send local env/secret files even if they appear under an allowed directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
